<title>UK: SmithKline up on merger talk.</title>
<headline>SmithKline up on merger talk.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in SmithKline Beecham jumped on Monday following a press report suggesting a possible link between the UK pharmaceutical concern and Shering-Plough of the U.S., dealers said.</p>
<p>By 0848 GMT, the shares were up 10p to 873-1/2.  </p>
<p>&quot;There's talk about the two (companies) talking with a view to merge. It's probably all speculation, but you don't want to be short with a story like that floating around,&quot; said one market maker.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
